  <h2>Philosophy</h2>
  <p>
    I value tools that are legible: code you can read top to bottom, designs you
    can hold in your head, math you can derive rather than memorize. I'd rather
    ship something small and correct than something large and impressive. This
    site reflects that — plain Markdown, no build-time magic I can't explain.
  </p>

